# Portal registration — primary surface (P4-B)

Make **`apps/portal`** the canonical guest registration host; marketing CTA and `apps/web` public routes **bridge** to portal only.

**Doc SoT:** this file · **Nano spec:** [`TEMP/p4/p4-b-portal-registration.md`](../../TEMP/p4/p4-b-portal-registration.md) v1.0

**Status (2026-06-21):** doc 9.9 · **P4-B complete** (14/14 nanos · unit/BFF specs green · Playwright soft)

---

## What P4-B actually delivers (honest scope)

| Deliverable                       | Detail                                                                           |
| --------------------------------- | -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |
| **Portal-primary (pre-P4 infra)** | M17 + DEC-P11-014 — P4-B closes with specs + gate + doc truth                    |
| **URL bridge**                    | marketing `resolveWebRegistrationUrl` · web redirect shim · portal host          |
| **BFF proof**                     | portal `public-auth/*` + `catalog/registrations` unit specs                      |
| **Static closure**                | M17 guard 30/30 in `p4:gate`                                                     |
| **Not in P4-B gate**              | Playwright SMK-PTL-01 · SMK-MKT-03 · SMK-DREG-01 (`p4:e2e-gate` · Architect YES) |

**Extends:** [`11.16-user-portal.md`](../phase-11/subphases/11.16-user-portal.md) · [`public-catalog.md`](../workspaces/denali/public-catalog.md) § Registration

---

## Executive summary

| Layer             | P4-B delivers                                                    |
| ----------------- | ---------------------------------------------------------------- |
| **Portal host**   | `{club}.portal.{root}` · dev port 3003                           |
| **OTP intake**    | Phone → OTP → profile → party size → success                     |
| **Marketing CTA** | `data-marketing-register` → portal registration URL              |
| **Web redirect**  | `apps/web` `/catalog/{id}/register` → portal (no duplicate flow) |
| **Prod env**      | `PORTAL_PUBLIC_BASE_URL` matrix documented + gated               |

---

## Goals

| Goal            | Detail                                           |
| --------------- | ------------------------------------------------ |
| Portal-primary  | Single registration UX in `apps/portal`          |
| Cross-app URLs  | Marketing resolves portal base via env           |
| E2E green       | SMK-PTL-01 · SMK-MKT-03 · SMK-DREG-01 (redirect) |
| Public auth API | `public-auth.routes.ts` unchanged contract       |

## Non-goals (P4-B v1)

- Member login / account portal beyond registration
- Apple/Google social login on portal
- Urban-only registration UX redesign
- Payment at registration

---

## Industry alignment

| Pattern                  | Source                          | P4-B mapping              |
| ------------------------ | ------------------------------- | ------------------------- |
| **Guest checkout OTP**   | Mobile-first event registration | Phone OTP before profile  |
| **Multi-app SSO bridge** | Subdomain URL routing           | Env-based portal base URL |
| **Single write surface** | DRY composable storefront       | One React flow in portal  |

