## Host map (frozen)

| Surface      | Host pattern                                   | App              |
| ------------ | ---------------------------------------------- | ---------------- |
| Marketing    | `shop.{club}.{root}` or `{club}.marketing` dev | `apps/marketing` |
| Portal       | `{club}.portal.{root}`                         | `apps/portal`    |
| Web redirect | `{club}.admin.{root}` public catalog path      | redirect only    |

---

## URL resolution

```typescript
// apps/marketing/src/portal/resolve-web-registration-url.ts
// Priority: PORTAL_PUBLIC_BASE_URL → dev host + PORTAL_DEV_PORT (3003)
```

| Env                         | App            | Purpose                 | Prod required |
| --------------------------- | -------------- | ----------------------- | ------------- |
| `PORTAL_PUBLIC_BASE_URL`    | marketing, web | Prod portal origin      | Yes (prod)    |
| `PORTAL_DEV_PORT`           | marketing      | Default `3003` local    | Dev only      |
| `MARKETING_PUBLIC_BASE_URL` | web            | Catalog redirect source | Yes (prod)    |

Marketing detail CTA:

```html
<a href="{registrationUrl}" data-marketing-register></a>
```

`registrationUrl` = `{portalBase}/catalog/{tourId}/register`

